<!--
    Indonesian. Translated from values/strings.xml; the names and the order match it one for one, so
    the two can be diffed side by side when a string changes.

    The folder is values-in, not values-id: Android's resource qualifier still uses the legacy ISO
    code for Indonesian, and values-id would never be selected.

    "Killit", "Shizuku", "adb", "QR" and "Android" are left as they are: they are names, not words.
-->
